1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
CanvasDiff puts your whole Git changeset
in one scrollable buffer.

2
00:00:02,631 --> 00:00:03,931
Jump hunks with ]h  /  [h
Review without hopping between files.

3
00:00:03,931 --> 00:00:05,231
Each + / − row is real source code
with Tree-sitter highlighting.

4
00:00:05,260 --> 00:00:06,561
Ghost deletions stay on the canvas
(dim + strikethrough) beside additions.

5
00:00:06,592 --> 00:00:07,792
The left sidebar lists every changed file
and its hunks.

6
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:09,221
Jump files with ]f  /  [f
Stage marks: ● staged  ○ unstaged  ●○ both.

7
00:00:09,259 --> 00:00:10,659
Deleted files appear too —
full content as pure-deletion ghosts.

8
00:00:10,695 --> 00:00:11,695
za folds a file into a one-line summary.
Great for skimming a large review.

9
00:00:11,695 --> 00:00:13,695
Folded files stay out of the way
until you open them again.

10
00:00:13,732 --> 00:00:15,332
za again unfolds.
Folds persist for this review session.

11
00:00:15,332 --> 00:00:17,332
Scroll deeper: the sticky header pins
the file + current hunk under the winbar.

12
00:00:17,365 --> 00:00:18,465
Lenses filter what you review.
Tab cycles: all → unstaged → staged.

13
00:00:18,465 --> 00:00:21,065
Unstaged lens: INDEX → WORKTREE
Only changes not yet staged.

14
00:00:21,096 --> 00:00:23,696
Staged lens: HEAD → INDEX
What will go into the next commit.

15
00:00:23,727 --> 00:00:25,727
All lens: HEAD → WORKTREE
The full picture of your worktree.

16
00:00:25,762 --> 00:00:26,462
Press Enter on any line to open
the real file at that exact spot.

17
00:00:26,462 --> 00:00:28,962
You land in a normal buffer —
LSP, Tree-sitter, unsaved edits intact.

18
00:00:28,997 --> 00:00:30,997
Ctrl+Space jumps back to the canvas
at the same review position.

19
00:00:30,997 --> 00:00:34,197
Need a reminder?  <leader>lh
opens the keybind cheatsheet.

20
00:00:34,230 --> 00:00:35,430
Close the cheatsheet with q.

21
00:00:35,430 --> 00:00:38,630
Compare any two revisions (READ-ONLY).
:CanvasDiff HEAD~1...HEAD or <leader>lb.

22
00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:40,860
Leave a stacked comparison to return
to your live worktree review.

23
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:42,260
Stage with s / S · unstage with u / U
Refresh with r · close with q.

25
00:00:43,293 --> 00:00:44,693
One canvas. Real files. Live Git.
Run :CanvasDiff to start.

26
00:00:44,693 --> 00:00:47,693
canvasdiff.nvim — pre-alpha
Your whole changeset, one buffer.
